"char_end": 254,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 30.975,
"end": 32.042,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Yes, that's correct.",
"char_start": 269,
"char_end": 289,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 32.042,
"end": 34.657,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "And that connects to what we're discussing today.",
"char_start": 290,
"char_end": 339,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 34.657,
"end": 40.628,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "I want to point out something \u2013 Marco Bellini mentioned the same issue a couple of episodes ago.",
"char_start": 356,
"char_end": 452,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 40.628,
"end": 42.86,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Can you give me a specific example?",
"char_start": 453,
"char_end": 488,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 42.86,
"end": 45.984,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 489,
"char_end": 538,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 45.984,
"end": 51.599,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Honestly, speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 553,
"char_end": 645,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 51.599,
"end": 54.223,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 646,
"char_end": 689,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 54.223,
"end": 58.434,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 690,
"char_end": 759,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 58.434,
"end": 60.256,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into this.",
"char_start": 776,
"char_end": 809,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 60.256,
"end": 63.016,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 810,
"char_end": 860,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 63.016,
"end": 63.624,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 875,
"char_end": 885,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 63.624,
"end": 69.885,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than minor adjustments to the suspension.",
"char_start": 886,
"char_end": 989,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 69.885,
"end": 74.627,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "The framing is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 990,
"char_end": 1068,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 74.627,
"end": 75.964,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Let's start from there.",
"char_start": 1085,
"char_end": 1108,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 75.964,
"end": 78.871,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1109,
"char_end": 1159,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 78.871,
"end": 85.643,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "Honestly, risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes \u2013 it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 1174,
"char_end": 1290,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 85.643,
"end": 88.095,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano.",
"char_start": 1291,
"char_end": 1333,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 88.095,
"end": 92.999,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "If you ignore it, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1334,
"char_end": 1418,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 92.999,
"end": 94.644,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "Where does it stop working?",
"char_start": 1435,
"char_end": 1462,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 94.644,
"end": 99.289,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this becomes particularly clear.",
"char_start": 1477,
"char_end": 1561,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 99.289,
"end": 103.215,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1562,
"char_end": 1633,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 103.215,
"end": 106.231,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "What is the heuristic that you always find yourself using?",
"char_start": 1650,
"char_end": 1708,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 106.231,
"end": 108.623,
"speaker_label": "Giulia Ferrara",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 1709,
"char_end": 1755,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 108.623,
"end": 109.763,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1770,
"char_end": 1790,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 109.763,
"end": 116.948,
"speaker_label": "Chiara Ricci",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the race track sections change the choice of trajectory between practice runs and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 1791,
"char_end": 1917,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 149.529,
"end": 151.276,
